1
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:05,793
Knight to Queen's Bishop 5.

2
00:00:05,964 --> 00:00:08,094
Ah. Very nice. What's Leonard gonna do?

3
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:10,508
(Howard:)Does he give up the pawn
or give up the position?

4
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:13,927
Mm. Let's find out. Leonard, ready?

5
00:00:14,431 --> 00:00:15,971
(Raj:)Ready.

6
00:00:16,141 --> 00:00:17,641
(Howard:)Go.

7
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:22,770
[HUMMING IN UNISON
KHACHATURIAN'S "SABRE DANCE"]

8
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:39,536
[BUZZER SOUNDS]

9
00:00:41,458 --> 00:00:42,588
(Leonard:)Damn it. I slipped.

10
00:00:43,001 --> 00:00:47,131
(Howard:)Too bad. You know the rules
of Secret Agent Laser Obstacle Chess.

11
00:00:48,214 --> 00:00:50,054
(Howard:)Leonard died again, Sheldon. You're up.

12
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:53,806
(Sheldon:)Despite my deep love of chess,
lasers and aerosol disinfectant...

13
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,350
(Sheldon:)...I must forfeit.

14
00:00:55,889 --> 00:00:58,349
- Why?
- Because it's almost 11:00.

15
00:00:58,516 --> 00:01:00,096
- So?
- So Penny has a...

16
00:01:00,268 --> 00:01:05,028
..."Don't knock on my door before 11:00
or I punch you in the throat" rule.

